<title>POLAND: NFI 11 nets PLN 41 mln H1.</title>
<headline>NFI 11 nets PLN 41 mln H1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) No. 11 preliminary results for the first half of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					H1 1997</p>
<p>  Net profit			 41.03</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  445.23</p>
<p>  Liabilities and provisions   64.02</p>
<p>  Net assets			413.98</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 13.34</p>
<p>NOTE: The full company name is XI Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny SA. It did not provide H1 1996 data.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
